<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - HBO &amp; Co raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Ruta Ledins resumed coverage of HBO &amp; Co, upgrading its rating to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said raised earnings per share estimates based on strong first quarter results, a more favorable outook, and recent acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 earnings estimate $1.70 a share from $1.60, and raised 1998 to $2.30 from $2.10.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 2-3/4 to 71-5/8.</p>
</text>
